; One net schedule.
FORM SCHEDULE
TITLE Net schedule
SUMMARY Adds or changes a net that meets on set days, so the box reminds you and can open it.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 50
ACTION sched_put
PREFILL schedule name
FIELD name Net name(X) required upper max=40
FIELD days Days(X) required upper
FIELD time Start(HHMM)Z required
FIELD minutes Minutes(###) default=60 check=number
FIELD channel Channel(@channels)
FIELD ncs Net control(X) upper max=16 check=station
FIELD roster Roster(X) upper
FIELD note Note(X) max=60
NEXT SCHEDULE BUNDLE_SEND
BEGIN_HELP
Days:
DAILY, WEEKDAYS, WEEKENDS, or days like TUE,THU. 1SAT is the first Saturday of the month, LSUN the last Sunday.
END

Start:
UTC, 24 hour: 1900.
END

Roster:
The stations or collectives expected, separated by commas.
END
